1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,620
A trail of numbers, winding across the grid...

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:05,840
but most of them are missing!

3
00:00:07,020 --> 00:00:08,220
This is Number Snake!

4
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:12,960
Place each number so it lands right next to the one before it!

5
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:15,300
Six is already there...

6
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,740
so seven goes right beside it...

7
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:24,260
Then eight goes next to seven — the trail keeps connecting, number by number!

8
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:31,400
Every number from one to sixteen, each one touching the next — that's the whole trail!

9
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:38,320
Parents — this builds sequencing and spatial thinking, one step at a time!

10
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:45,720
Tap Math Game Zone, wind through Number Snake, pick your level, and complete the trail!

11
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:52,240
Abacus Kids — no charge to play, on the App Store and Google Play!
